<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mostly lower in heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 1.16 to 6304.87. For the week, the Dow fell 77.07 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.22 to 384.07.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1418 to 1033.</p>
<p>Volume was 454,475,050, compared with 492,759,210 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,280,285,050.</p>
